1. What is text editor?

(Considering only text files).
A text editor is a facility, provided to read/write/update/delete text using a cmd line or gui interface
-we can open existing text file
-create a new file
-delete file/file content
-multiple windows/tabs operations can be performed
-text featuring is also there like: personalised text/window, file extendsions, text processing(unicode, ascii etc), editors shortcut/navigation keys
-all types of characters, notations and languages should be supported
-cursor, key, window manipulation.


